<title>USA: Gottschalks May same-store sales up 5.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Gottschalks May same-store sales up 5.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRESNO, Calif. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gottschalks Inc said Thursday that May sales were $33.2 million, up 5.9 percent over May 1996 sales of $31.4 million. Same-store sales were up 5.9 percent.</p>
<p>For the first 17 weeks of 1997, total sales increased 5.8 percent to $123.8 million from $117.0 million last year. Same-store sales were up 5.5 percent.</p>
</text>
